Package: LiWaP
Title: Livestock Water Partitioning Model
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Lydia", "Lanzoni", email = "lydia.lanzoni@fao.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates the partitioning of water in livestock production
    systems at the cohort level. The model combines species-specific water
    intake equations with feed dry matter content, ambient temperature,
    lactation, milk production, live weight gain, egg production, and grazing
    information to calculate feed water, drinking water, and total water
    intake. It partitions intake into water outputs in feces, milk, eggs,
    growth, urine, and evaporation, and estimates consumptive water use after
    accounting for water returned to grazed land.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
